<title>USA: Boyds Wheels names Asher president/COO.</title>
<headline>Boyds Wheels names Asher president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boyds Wheels Inc said Monday that David Asher will join the company in mid-June as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Asher, 48, was most recently president, chief operating officer and owner of Marshall Distributing Inc., a large regional wholesale distributor of personal recreational vehicle parts and accessories.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be learned who Asher was replacing.</p>
